  cropData: {fileID: 0}
  creatureData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a3f2bb9ea16f5242b1fc5432a77b36c, type: 2}
  description:
  - 'This half-plant half-mole hybrid is thought to be the aftermath of two or more
    species undergoing rabid mutation at the same time, leading to the development
    of this new species. While buried, it hijacks the root structure of nearby flora,
    consuming their nutrients. '
  - The nose-like appendage on its snout has incredible generative capabilites, being
    able to replicate the structure of any nearby plant. The nose also has exocrine
    glands that secrete a vile scent, often deterring potential predators. It is
    this distict scent that is the strongest indicator of a Plant Mimic's presence.
